{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31493","headline":"别尹链师 · 李羣玉","name":"别尹链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾家五千言，至道悬日月。\n若非函谷令，谁注流沙说。\n多君飞昇志，机悟独超拔。\n学道玉笥山，烧丹白云穴。\n南穷衡疑秀，采药历幽绝。\n夜卧瀑布风，朝行碧岩雪。\n洞宫四百日，玉籍恣探阅。\n徒以菌蟪姿，缅攀修真诀。\n尘笼罩浮世，遐思空飞越。\n一罢棋酒欢，离情满寥泬。\n愿骑紫盖鹤，早向黄金阙。\n城市不可留，尘埃秽仙骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}